            <ArticleTitle>Forty years of collaborative computational crystallography.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>202-206</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/pro.3298</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A brief overview is provided of the history of collaborative computational crystallography, with an emphasis on the Collaborative Computational Project No. 4. The key steps in its development are outlined, with consideration also given to the underlying reasons which contributed, and ultimately led to, the unprecedented success of this venture.</AbstractText>
